# 4. AIRCRACK-NG

**Aircrack-ng** is a wireless security assessment suite.

It contains tools for different stages of wireless auditing.

Important components include:

| Tool | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `airmon-ng` | Manage/assist with monitor mode |
| `airodump-ng` | Capture and display wireless traffic |
| `aireplay-ng` | Generate/replay certain wireless frames in authorized testing |
| `aircrack-ng` | Analyze captures and attempt key recovery |
| `airdecap-ng` | Decrypt captured traffic when appropriate keys are available |
| `airbase-ng` | Wireless AP testing functionality |

### Memory

> **Monitor → Capture → Analyze → Validate**

