# 53. DEFENSE AGAINST WEP CRACKING

Simple answer:

> **Do not use WEP.**

Migrate to:

```text
WPA3
```

or where appropriate:

```text
WPA2-AES/CCMP
```

---

# 54. DEFENSE AGAINST WPA2 PASSWORD GUESSING

Use:

- Long passwords
- Unique passwords
- Random passphrases
- WPA3 where supported
- Enterprise authentication where appropriate
- Strong AP administration
- Network segmentation
- Monitoring

---

# 55. ENTERPRISE DEFENSE

For organizations:

```text
WPA2/WPA3 Enterprise
